window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"kassadin","b":"masteryi","win":["Kassadin","Skill","Master Yi","Master Yi","Master Yi","Master Yi","Kassadin"],"spikes":[{"when":"Level 1","text":"Your only early edge: Null Sphere reaches 650 to Alpha Strike's 600, and returns in 9s against his 20."},{"when":"Yi levels 3-5","text":"Wuju Style is true damage — armour and Void Stone both read zero. Hug tower and take the farm given."},{"when":"Yi first item","text":"His spike lands long before yours and Meditate refunds your chip — don't step up without vision and cover."},{"when":"Your late-game items","text":"Stacked Riftwalk finally out-paces Highlander — you blink, you don't kite, because his R ignores slows."}],"wants":{"you":["Win level 1, then disengage","Cancel Meditate with Null Sphere","Scale to Riftwalk blinks, not slows"],"foe":["Crush you with true damage at 3-5","Heal a lost trade with Meditate","End before your Riftwalk stacks"]},"early":"Take the level-1 trade — Null Sphere reaches 650 to Alpha Strike's 600 and returns in 9s to his 20 — then swallow your pride, because from 3 on Wuju Style's true damage ignores every resistance you own. Farm at max range, ward early, and treat any extended trade from 3 to 5 as volunteered.","mid":"Even at 6 your Riftwalk cannot out-trade Highlander, and his first-item spike lands long before your AP does. One thing works: Meditate is a channel and Null Sphere interrupts channels, so every heal he starts on that 10s cooldown, you cancel. Otherwise hold the wave near tower and blink out.","late":"This is why you suffered: stacked Riftwalk blinks away from every Highlander charge and chunks him between resets. Do not count on Force Pulse to peel — Highlander makes him immune to slows. Blink onto him only once Alpha Strike is down, and note his autos shorten its 20 seconds.","whys":["Your Null Sphere out-ranges Alpha Strike 650 to 600 and returns twice as fast.","By 2 it evens out as your weak pre-6 kit starts to show.","Wuju Style's true damage crushes your level 3.","At 4-5 he out-DPSes you, and Meditate heals back whatever you land.","Even at 6, Riftwalk cannot out-trade a slow-immune Highlander.","His first-item spike lands well before your AP scaling does.","Late, stacked Riftwalk blinks past Highlander — slows won't, blinks do."]});
